Description: Provides a single function to download Neglected Tropical Disease
    (NTD) data from the ESPEN (Expanded Special Project for Elimination of
    Neglected Tropical Diseases) portal API. Users supply a country name or
    ISO2 code, disease, spatial level, and optional year range, and receive a
    tidy data frame. Supported diseases include lymphatic filariasis (lf),
    onchocerciasis (oncho), loiasis (loa), schistosomiasis (sch), soil-
    transmitted helminths (sth), trachoma, and co-endemicity. An API key is
    required and can be obtained from the ESPEN portal at
    <https://espen.afro.who.int>.
